s8: $ … ⇒ ⋃ (nsub a j) ⊆ nsub a j $ by n3_cuni_le_c [s7]
s9: $ G , j ∊ ω , nsub a j ⊆ a , w = suc j ⇒ nsub a j ⊆ a $ by ax
s10: $ … ⇒ ⋃ (nsub a j) ⊆ a $ by subset_trans [s8, s9]
s11: $ … ⇒ ⋃ (nsub a j) = nsub a w $ by eq_sym [s6]
s12: $ … ⇒ nsub a w ⊆ a $ by subset_eq_l [s11, s10]
i3: $ … ⇒ nsub a b ⊆ a $ by omega_ind_named [b6, s12, #2]

